If you dont like desktop environment heres the window manager that available for syslack linux
WindowManagers In Syslack Linux List
-Fluxbox 
-Blackbox 
-WindowMaker 
-IceWM
-twm

For fluxbox
sudo apt install fluxbox -y

For blackbox
sudo apt install blackbox -y

For WindowMaker
sudo apt install wmaker -y

For IceWM
sudo apt install icewm -y

For TWM
sudo apt install twm -y
